        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aaboolela Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali, “Babaandu se banyala baniina khu sikulu sia Sinai tawe, sikila ewe wamweene wakhulaka oli khure khu sikulu lulwakha mala khulutakaase.”",
